WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:06.120
Meet Motiq. Smart programming, real form feedback, and your whole team, in one app.

00:06.870 --> 00:17.409
Every day starts on Today. Your body lights up where you trained this week, cool blue when you're rested and violet when you've worked hard, right next to your readiness score and today's session.

00:18.459 --> 00:25.456
Your plan adapts around it. A strong week levels it up, a game on Saturday tapers it, and you can always see why.

00:26.506 --> 00:32.885
Building a program starts with your goal, your sport and position, your age group, and how many days you can train.

00:33.935 --> 00:41.807
The builder already knows you. Your maxes, today's bar speed, your movement screen, your form faults, and the gaps in your recent training.

00:42.857 --> 00:50.323
Seconds later, you have a full block. Speed work comes first while you're fresh, loads build week to week, and the last week deloads.

00:51.373 --> 01:01.613
Want a change? Just type it. And it checks its own work. If the week is missing single-leg work, or has too many jumps for your level, it flags it, and one tap fixes it.

01:02.663 --> 01:08.381
It draws on four hundred exercises matched to your sport, and every one has an animated demo.

01:09.431 --> 01:16.641
During a session, every set is logged as you go, and your effort and bar speed teach the plan how hard to push next time.

01:17.691 --> 01:27.441
Then there's the form checker. Pick a lift, a jump landing, a sprint start, or your running, and film a set. A quick camera check makes sure your setup is right first.

01:28.491 --> 01:34.037
Motiq tracks thirty-three body points right on your phone, so your video never leaves the device.

01:35.087 --> 01:41.957
It builds a target figure from your own limb lengths, and lays it over your movement, so you can see exactly what good looks like.

01:43.007 --> 01:49.812
Every check is scored, along with how sure it is. Here, the foot lands out in front, and cadence is a little low.

01:50.862 --> 01:59.673
Each fix comes with a cue and a drill. Your coach can reply right on the clip, and your program adds the drill to your warm-ups until a re-check passes.

02:00.723 --> 02:04.307
Or go live, and Motiq counts and checks every rep as you move.

02:05.357 --> 02:15.170
Motiq looks at the whole body, connecting form, screens, strength and soreness. Real problems show in amber, so they stand out before they turn into injuries.

02:16.220 --> 02:22.855
Measure jumps, sprints, and left-right differences with just your phone camera. Testing day walks the whole team through it.

02:23.905 --> 02:25.377
Goals steer the whole plan.

02:26.427 --> 02:28.987
Wellness tracks food, water and recovery.

02:30.037 --> 02:32.063
Everyone shares one team calendar.

02:33.113 --> 02:36.484
Coaches see who's ready, who's at risk, and who needs attention.

02:37.534 --> 02:40.691
And recruiting profiles show coach-verified numbers.

02:42.041 --> 02:46.436
Motiq. Train smarter. Move better. Free in your browser, on any device.
